{"4369220": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Flappy Together", "steam_appid": 4369220, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🦇 A Co-op Game Where Flying Is a Permanent Mistake</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're a bat controlled with... just two buttons. One button for each wing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In solo, you control both wings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In co-op, each player controls one.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It sounds simple.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It isn't.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🕹️ Simple to Learn. Brutal to Master.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The rules couldn't be simpler:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2 buttons</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1 bat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1 mistake... and you're dead.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Touch a wall, the floor, the ceiling, or any obstacle, and it's game over. No health bar. No second chances.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every flap matters.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🤝 Solo or Co-op</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In solo, you're in complete control of both wings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In local or online co-op, each player controls one wing. A single misunderstanding, one mistimed flap, or a moment of hesitation is enough to send your bat straight into a wall.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Work together... or get ready to start over.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🏆 Climb the Leaderboards</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Race to the finish and compare your best times with players from around the world on the online leaderboards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Finishing the game is already an achievement.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mastering it is something else.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Good luck. And try not to hit the walls.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Note: A controller is required for local multiplayer.</i></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🦇 A Co-op Game Where Flying Is a Permanent Mistake</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're a bat controlled with... just two buttons. One button for each wing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In solo, you control both wings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In co-op, each player controls one.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It sounds simple.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It isn't.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🕹️ Simple to Learn. Brutal to Master.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The rules couldn't be simpler:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2 buttons</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1 bat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1 mistake... and you're dead.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Touch a wall, the floor, the ceiling, or any obstacle, and it's game over. No health bar. No second chances.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every flap matters.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🤝 Solo or Co-op</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In solo, you're in complete control of both wings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In local or online co-op, each player controls one wing. A single misunderstanding, one mistimed flap, or a moment of hesitation is enough to send your bat straight into a wall.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Work together... or get ready to start over.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🏆 Climb the Leaderboards</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Race to the finish and compare your best times with players from around the world on the online leaderboards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Finishing the game is already an achievement.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mastering it is something else.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Good luck. And try not to hit the walls.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Note: A controller is required for local multiplayer.</i></p>", "short_description": "A co-op platformer where two players must fly as a single bat. Each player controls one wing. Playing solo? You control both. Navigate a long, unforgiving level filled with deadly obstacles, strange biomes, and musical checkpoints. Crash. Retry. Blame each other.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4369220/93305c4df8db80f85ce9cc939405b26bb376f37a/header.jpg?t=1785750691", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4369220/d011eae818794e14f1984c2095db9b72c9423ce9/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1785750691", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4369220/d011eae818794e14f1984c2095db9b72c9423ce9/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1785750691", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2 Ghz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GTX 750 / AMD Radeon R7 260X<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 400 MB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "legal_notice": "Copyright © 2025 Lunar Code Studio. All rights reserved.", "developers": ["Lunar Code Studio"], "publishers": ["Lunar Code Studio"], "price_overview": {"currency": "USD", "initial": 399, "final": 399, "discount_percent": 0, "initial_formatted": "", "final_formatted": "$3.99"}, "packages": [1526668], "package_groups": [{"name": "default", "title": "Buy Flappy Together", "description": "", "selection_text": "Select a purchase option", "save_text": "", "display_type": 0, "is_recurring_subscription": "false", "subs": [{"packageid": 1526668, "percent_savings_text": " ", "percent_savings": 0, "option_text": "Flapping Together - $3.99", "option_description": "", "can_get_free_license": "0", "is_free_license": false, "price_in_cents_with_discount": 399}]}], "platforms": {"windows": true, "mac": false, "linux": false}, "categories": [{"id": 2, "desc